Changes
=======

v4.0.3 28 Apr 2026
  * Switch JWE examples from RSA1_5 to RSA-OAEP+A256GCM (RSA1_5 is deprecated).
  * Various comment / usage clarifications across the example set; make
    jwk_example runnable offline.

v4.0.2 19 Apr 2026
  * Bump jwx/v4 and all companion deps to v4.0.0 stable releases.

v4.0.1 13 Apr 2026
  * Bump companion deps to latest alpha releases (asmbase64 v4.0.0-alpha3,
    es256k v4.0.0-alpha2, jwkcache v4.0.0-alpha2, mldsa v4.0.0-alpha2,
    x448 v4.0.0-alpha3).
  * Add ML-KEM JWE example (mlkem_encrypt_decrypt_example_test.go).
  * Add composite signature JWS example (compsig_sign_verify_example_test.go,
    ML-DSA-65 + ECDSA P-256).
  * Add hybrid PQ HPKE JWE example (pqchpke_encrypt_decrypt_example_test.go,
    HPKE-10-KE / X-Wing).

v4.0.0 8 Apr 2026
  * Initial release. Runnable example coverage for jwt, jws, jwe, jwk,
    and the cross-package jwx readme example, plus ed448 JWS examples.
